PTX MP+tensormap+no-acquire-proxy-fence
"As MP+tensormap+proxy-fences with a plain fence.acq_rel.gpu on the reader: the generic acquire does not order the tensormap-proxy read (D37). Expected: allowed."
{
tm=0;
g=5;
d=0 @cta 1;
b=mbarrier(1) @cta 1;
f=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r2=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                                     | P1@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0                                                                         ;
 tensormap.replace.tile.global_address.global.b1024.b64 tm, 1 | ld.relaxed.gpu r0, f                                                                             ;
 fence.proxy.tensormap::generic.release.gpu                   | fence.acq_rel.gpu                                                                                ;
 st.relaxed.gpu f, 1                                          | cp.async.bulk.tensor.1d.shared::cluster.global.tile.mbarrier::complete_tx::bytes d, g, b, tm, r2 ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r2 == 0)
